### Send invoice email

POST {{baseUrl}}/invoice/send-email/69e1cd3e746f0ebcda851c80 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{estMir}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "message": "Thanks for your business!",
  "sendMeCopy": false,
  "subject": "Your Invoice from Geo Paving and Sealcoating",
  "to": [
    "shahjalal.backend@gmail.com"
  ]
}


### Update invoice email status to READ and sign invoice

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invoice/update-email-sign/69fed1c2f5472591e0ad4cd2 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{estMir}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "emailStatus": "READ",
  "mySignAt": "2026-05-11T00:00:00.000Z",
  "mySignName": "Kal Sayegh",
  "signedName": "John Doe"
}


