### get invoice number

GET {{baseUrl}}/invoice/invoice-number HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{admin}}


### 1. Remove sideMap (single image)

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invoice/invoice-images/69fec7765d2d85a94fa2f764 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sideMapAction": "remove"
}


### 2. Replace sideMap (upload new image)

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invoice/invoice-images/69fec7765d2d85a94fa2f764 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bodyData"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "sideMapAction": "replace"
}

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="sideMap"; filename="new-side-map.jpg"
Content-Type: image/jpeg

< ./new-side-map.jpg
------WebKitFormBoundary--


### 3. Add two fileUrls (upload multiple)

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invoice/invoice-images/69fec7765d2d85a94fa2f764 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bodyData"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileUrlsAction": "add"
}

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fileUrls"; filename="doc1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./doc1.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fileUrls"; filename="doc2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./doc2.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary--


### 4. Remove specific fileUrls

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invoice/invoice-images/69fec7765d2d85a94fa2f764 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileUrls": [
    "https://space.com/old-file.pdf",
    "https://space.com/another.pdf"
  ],
  "fileUrlsAction": "remove"
}


### 5. Replace specific fileUrls (upload same number of new files)

PATCH {{baseUrl}}/invoice/invoice-images/69fec7765d2d85a94fa2f764 HTTP/1.1
Authorization: {{admin}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=----WebKitFormBoundary

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="bodyData"
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "fileUrlsAction": "replace",
  "fileUrls": ["https://space.com/old1.pdf", "https://space.com/old2.pdf"]
}

------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fileUrls"; filename="new1.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./new1.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="fileUrls"; filename="new2.pdf"
Content-Type: application/pdf

< ./new2.pdf
------WebKitFormBoundary--
